    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73159" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλκ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ship which is towed</i> : hence, <i>trading vessel,
				merchantman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				137
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				32.25
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὁλκάσιν ἢ πλοίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. σιταγωγοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.44
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰναγωγοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					143.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cephisod.
				10
			</span></i> : metaph., of women, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.160
			</span></i> ; of Europa's bull, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of stones,
				<i>conveyed</i> to the place of building, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).199
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				79
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλκάς: . . παρ᾽ Ἀλκμᾶνι
			ἀειδῶν</span> (i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀηδών,</span>
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλκάς</span>
			), Cyr.Coisl.<i><span class="en">
				394
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				43.451
			</span></i>).</div>
